        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, nia, kinde ma Apolo ni i Korinto, Paolo m’udaru kadhu kud i ng’om ma yo malu ebino Efeso, man enwang’u julub moko: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e epenjogi kumae, Wujolo Tipo Maleng’ ka wuyio? Giloko lembe de giwacu ire kumae, Ungo, kadok awinja de wawinjo ngo nia Tipo Maleng’ umire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu kumae, Ka kumeno jumio iwu baputisi ma mir ang’o? Giwacu kumae, Baputisi pa Yohana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
